From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LNPANDY <lnp-andy@hotmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:02:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] host: read embedded sections from the image that holds the
 host (DM_HOST_IMAGE)

Define DM_HOST_IMAGE as &__dso_handle in dm/host/host_image.h and pass it to getsectiondata and loader image checks in hle.c, loader.c, hle_jit.c, hle_nvn.c, hle_vk.m and hle_gl.m. In the main executable __dso_handle aliases _mh_execute_header; in a dynamic framework it resolves to that framework's Mach-O header so the HLE registration tables (__DATA,swhle, __DATA,swforce, __DATA,swnvn, __DATA,swvk and __DATA,swgl) are found in the image that holds the host.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Let the host read its Mach-O sections when linked into a dynamic framework as well as the main executable
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#451
---
 dm/gfx/gl/hle_gl.m          | 5 ++---
 dm/gfx/nvn/hle_nvn.c        | 5 ++---
 dm/gfx/tests/t_gl_imports.m | 2 +-
 dm/gfx/vk/hle_vk.m          | 5 ++---
 dm/host/hle.c               | 5 ++---
 dm/host/hle_jit.c           | 5 ++---
 dm/host/host_image.h        | 8 ++++++++
 dm/host/loader.c            | 7 +++----
 8 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 dm/host/host_image.h

